The README enumerated what the pack's suite asserts; 29b2205 added a
guard it did not mention. Adds "Why run state is appended, never
replaced" — the reason the cross-step contract_path handoff needs
--append-notes, and why the failure surfaces two steps from its cause —
and names the new invariant in the Tests section so the enumeration
stays complete.
